# Generated outputs, regenerated by running the scripts.
# Never the tracked sample-data folders, which are inputs.

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env

# 01-content-brain: the board the scripts write, and your own dropped-in items
01-content-brain/board.md
01-content-brain/my-items/

# 02-context-layer: your corrections log. The rooms ship as blank templates and
# get filled in place, so expect local diffs there once you run the interview.
02-context-layer/memory.md

# 04-motion-studio: the generated animation, frame strips, and rendered video,
# plus the brand and brief you copy up from sample-data to make your own
04-motion-studio/out/
04-motion-studio/brand.json
04-motion-studio/brief.txt

# 05-the-arena: Q-table checkpoints from training. sample-data/trained-agent.json
# is tracked on purpose so watch.py works before you train anything.
05-the-arena/output/
